    ["<Assistant_Title1>【人脉好感-互动】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>漫步玩法说明：</>各位非凡者可以通过消耗<Assistant_Red>【漫忆请柬】</>道具，邀请自己拥有的人脉在<Assistant_Red>大世界地图中</>完成漫步互动，漫步期间人脉将跟随各位非凡者，各位非凡者也可邀请人脉进行坐骑同乘、社交互动动作等互动。\n<Assistant_Title2>邀约玩法说明：</>各位非凡者可以通过消耗<Assistant_Red>【漫忆请柬】</>道具，邀请自己拥有的人脉邀约互动，邀约将会把非凡者与人脉传送到专属场景进行话题邀约谈话，与人脉的好感度等级越高，可以对话的话题越多。\n<Assistant_Title2>共舞玩法说明：</>各位非凡者可以通过消耗<Assistant_Red>【漫忆请柬】</>道具，邀请自己拥有的人脉共舞互动，共舞会邀请自己的人脉角色进入艺术学院，人脉角色可以根据各位非凡者上传的视频，进行视频中的动作。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Connection Favorability - Interaction】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Strolling Gameplay Instructions: </>Every Beyonder can consume <Assistant_Red>【Memory Invitation】</> items to invite their connections to complete a Strolling interaction on the <Assistant_Red>World Map</>. During the stroll, the connection will follow the Beyonder, and the Beyonder can also invite the connection to perform interactions such as riding a mount together or social action emotes. \n<Assistant_Title2>Appointment Gameplay Instructions: </>Every Beyonder can consume <Assistant_Red>【Memory Invitation】</> items to invite their connections for an Appointment interaction. The appointment will teleport the Beyonder and the connection to an exclusive scene for a conversation. The higher the favorability level with the connection, the more topics can be discussed. \n<Assistant_Title2>Dancing Gameplay Instructions: </>Every Beyonder can consume <Assistant_Red>【Memory Invitation】</> items to invite their connections for a Dancing interaction. Dancing will invite the connection character to the Art Academy, where the connection character can perform the actions from the video uploaded by the Beyonder.",
